  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring landmines and cluster munition use 2021-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this investment supports the Australian Government&apos;s obligation to support to the implementation and effective operation of the Convention on Cluster Munitions and the Anti-Personnel Mine Ban Convention (otherwise known as the Ottawa Convention). Funding supports transparency through the International Campaign to Ban Landmines &#x2013; Cluster Munitions Coalition (ICBL-CMC), a defacto monitor of these conventions reporting annually on usage, stockpiles, clearance and victim assistance. ICBL-CMC also plays a strong advocacy role and participates and supports engagement with developing countries to ensure the effective function of the conventions.</narrative>
  </description>
